{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>機電工程署巡查發現，有承辦商未有按要求為觀塘翠屏北邨及沙田博康邨升降機安裝門框組件，並涉嫌提供虛假文件。</p><p></p><p>警方傍晚公布拘捕三名男子，據了解包括一名79歲姓張的臺日電梯公司股東兼董事、兩名註冊自動梯工程師分別82歲的員工及63歲外聘顧問。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.LIFT.ARREST-1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026hnViuPpF4r1792147404.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T11:39:59.730059+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T10:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T12:37:50.719362+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T11:37:46.155428+00:00","content_hash":"36a5721c7b159eed322912a7fe094131a94c78e3e9b80c02162ad7e570747de7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}